# Riichi discard called (pon): reach_accepted IS emitted BEFORE the pon, the 1,000 stick
# IS paid, and the completed pon cancels Seat 0's ippatsu (engine.md §4.1 rows 3/6, §4.2, §6).
# Seat 0 declares riichi and discards 7z -> Seat 2 pons 7z -> reach_accepted(0) then pon(2).
# Seat 2 discards 9p, Seat 3 tsumogiris, Seat 0 draws 4s and wins by tsumo -> NO ippatsu!
# Scoring for Seat 0 (dealer, East):
#   Hand: 123m 456m 789p 23s 99s + tsumo 4s (wait 1s/4s ryanmen; 99s non-yakuhai)
#   Yaku: double_riichi (2) + tsumo (1) + pinfu (1) = 4 han (NO ippatsu!).
#   Dora indicator 1z -> dora 2z (0 dora). Ura indicator 5z -> ura 6z (0 ura).
#   Fu: Pinfu + Tsumo = fixed 20 fu.
#   Dealer tsumo 4 han 20 fu = 2600 all (+7800 from opponents).
#   Seat 0 also paid 1000 stick and recovers it (+1000 from table) -> net +7800.
#   Deltas: +7800 -2600 -2600 -2600, sticks: 0.

[meta]
